    <briefdescription>
<para>Series data uploaded to the GPU as an RGBA8888 texture, one float per texel. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Materials hold it through a <computeroutput>std::shared_ptr</computeroutput>, so several nodes of one series can sample the same upload. It is created and destroyed on the render thread, like the materials holding it. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
